                                "sense_id": "62296ef7-7055-3cea-babc-6e789601c15d",
                                "text": "They made their stateside debut in the late 1970s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a8fd336-cc8b-4639-8ed9-a6e812ad25fb",
                                "sense_id": "62296ef7-7055-3cea-babc-6e789601c15d",
                                "text": "Q: Why do I need a new stateside driver’s license if my expired license is good as long as I am in military?\nA current, valid stateside driver’s license is required to get a USAREUR driving permit and international driving permit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48a0779d-a741-4406-a09f-a1b38ffe33b6",
                                "sense_id": "62296ef7-7055-3cea-babc-6e789601c15d",
                                "text": "“Yonks,” he replies when I ask how long he's been stateside. “It's not like I've become American. I'm in England every year.”"
                            }
